      "DSN: Sender_address: %s\n"
      "DSN: orcpt: %s  flags: %d\n"
      "DSN: envid: %s  ret: %d\n"
      "DSN: Final recipient: %s\n"
      "DSN: Remote SMTP server supports DSN: %d\n",
      addr_dsntmp->router ? addr_dsntmp->router->name : US"(unknown)",
